one ordinary share of nominal DKK 1.00 in the company at a subscription price of USD 1.83 converted into DKK using the official exchange
rate between DKK and USD on the exercise day, however no less than DKK 1 per share of nominal DKK 1, provided, however, that the adjustment
mechanisms in clause 6 of appendix 5 to the articles of association may result in a different number of shares and/or a different subscription
price.</FONT></TD></TR>
