    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 14pt; padding-left: 0pt; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 14pt; width: 45%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">De ansl&aring;ede omkostninger, der skal afholdes
