    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 14pt; padding-left: 0pt; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 14pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 14pt; padding-left: 0pt; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 14pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">All numbers in these articles of association
have been adjusted to take into account share split from nominal DKK 2 to nominal DKK 1 and issuance of bonus shares in the ratio of
17-for-1 as resolved by respectively the general meeting and the board of directors on 4 January 2021.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
