    <TD STYLE="font: 11pt/14pt Verdana, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; padding-right: 12.45pt; padding-bottom: 14pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">Form&aring;let med denne Aftale er at tildele
