</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.05pt">med </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">oplysning </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.05pt">om
</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">det &oslash;nskede antal </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">kapitalandele </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">samt
en </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">eventuel Yderligere Forpligtelseserkl&aelig;ring. </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">Samti</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">dig
</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.05pt">med </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">fremsendelsen </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.05pt">af
</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">Udnyttelsesmeddelelsen </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">og </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">eventuelt
Yderligere Forpligtelseserkl&aelig;ring </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">skal </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">Warrantindehaveren
betale </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.05pt">et </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">kontant </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">bel&oslash;b
</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">til Selskabet </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">svarende til </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">det
</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">relevante </FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.1pt">teg</FONT><FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: 0.15pt">ningsbel&oslash;b.</FONT></FONT></TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; font: 11pt/14pt Verdana, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; padding-right: 9.9pt; padding-bottom: 14pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black; letter-spacing: 0.15pt">Notification
    </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black; letter-spacing: 0.1pt">of exercise
