    <P STYLE="font: 8.5pt/14.5pt Verdana, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: Black">Evaxion
    biotech A/S</FONT></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 8.5pt/14.5pt Verdana, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: Black">(Company
    reg. no. (CBR) 31762863)</FONT></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 8.5pt/14.5pt Verdana, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">(the
    &quot;<B>Company</B>&quot;)</FONT></P></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black"><B>INTRODUKTION</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black"><B>INTRODUCTION</B></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">I
    henhold til bemyndigelse i vedt&aelig;gternes punkt 2.10 har bestyrelsen bestemt, at f&oslash;lgende vilk&aring;r og betingelser
    skal v&aelig;re g&aelig;ldende for op til <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6pt">9.726.898</FONT> warrants
    (&quot;<B>Warrants</B>&quot;), der er udstedt til investorer (&rdquo;<B>Warrantindehavere</B>&rdquo;) i forbindelse med tegning af
    aktier og warrants (&rdquo;<B>Udbudte V&aelig;rdipapirer</B>&rdquo;) i forbindelse med den rettede emission gennemf&oslash;rt <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6pt">21.
    </FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black; letter-spacing: 0.6pt">december
    <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase">2023.</FONT></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">Pursuant
    to the authorisation in article 2.10 of the articles of association, the Board of Directors has resolved that the following terms
    and conditions shall apply to up to <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6pt">9,726,898 </FONT>warrants (the
    &ldquo;<B>Warrants</B>&rdquo;) which have been granted to investors (&ldquo;<B>Warrantholders</B>&rdquo;) in connection with the
    subscription of ordinary shares and warrants (together, the &ldquo;<B>Offer Securities</B>&rdquo;) in the private placement directed
    issue carried out <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6pt">21 d</FONT></FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black; letter-spacing: 0.6pt">ecember
    <FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase">2023.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 14pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: Black">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    &nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black"><B>GENERELT</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black"><B>GENERAL</B></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 14.5pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

