    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; width: 45%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Udnyttelsesprisen p&aring; enhver endnu ikke udnyttet warrant ganges med faktoren:</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; width: 2%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; width: 45%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The Exercise Price for each non-exercised Warrant shall be multiplied by the factor:</FONT></TD></TR>
